nuori-ai/
# CKE exam text redistributed by third-party datasets (old 8-subject pipeline); hackathon rule: no CKE content in the
# repo. Re-create locally with: python scripts/fetch_external.py
data/blocklist/*.jsonl
data/eval/ext_llmzszl_matura.jsonl
# organizers' prawko-v2 driving-licence eval splits (third-party rows, licence not verified): keep them out of the repo,
# re-create with python scripts/import_prawko.py
data/eval/ext_prawko_*.jsonl
# RAG knowledge base (Wikipedia articles, title resolution, BM25 index, build report); only the title list is
# committed. Rebuild with: python scripts/build_rag.py
data/rag/*
!data/rag/titles_history.yaml
# LLM-filled targets for CKE tasks ({id, answer}; many follow the CKE answer key's model answer): CKE-derived, so they
# stay local like data/processed/. Copy them to the box together with data/rag/ and data/processed/history/.
data/history/llm_filled_answers*.jsonl
data/history/filled_*/
# an exam pack unzipped in the repo root (the mock zip has no top folder; CKE text and page crops), CKE PDFs,
